  vendorName: Tycoon Tiberius
  offerText: My private laboratory has developed a proprietary serum. The financial
    investment is severe, but one injection will leave you feeling like a physical
    god for the foreseeable future.
  acceptResultText: You hand over the heavy briefcase of cash and take the injection.
    Every ache vanishes entirely. You have never felt such raw, pulsing vitality
    in your entire life!
  rejectResultText: Tiberius laughs at your frailty. You spend the next hour nursing
    a persistent, aching cough and feeling profoundly weak.
